 "notes": "Episode 8 pack atlas, merged into bosses_battle. The Eraser (bosses.png cell 7, 1x, not flipped) in four looks: eraser (Closed Book, as painted: black and violet robes, the empty white face, the floating pages), eraser_truths (The Rejected Truths: the robes spread like two book covers, Grief and Change small in the folds), eraser_remembers (The Keeper Remembers: the face half drawn in gold lines), eraser_silence (The Last Silence: the robes torn to blank pages, the face a white glare, the pages stopped). Each has _idle_1, _attack, _hurt, _cast, _die_0..2. The phases name their look (E8-battle's enemies.js `sprite`; ai.js enterPhase forwards it). `hud`: one anchor per look, the same in all four (CRITIQUE_8 item 1): `hood` is the top of the hood over the face's left edge (the top-left of the body; the dark ring above is not counted) as [dx, dy] from the bottom-centre origin (dy negative, up); `headPx` the hood and face box [x0, x1, y0, y1] from the origin; `head` the same box as fractions of that look's packed frame (layout.js HEAD_BOX format)."
